+            $$ \text{cube\_end} = \text{cube\_ori} + \text{cube\_size} $$
+            where `cube_size` is the physical size of a voxel at the current level, calculated as $256 / 2^{\text{level}}$ (assuming a base resolution of 256) [S1, unofficial].
